**Absent a written NDA/evaluation grant, all rights are reserved.**

### 3.2 Public marketing pages

If any public marketing, landing, or status pages are published by the Rightsholder, You may view those pages for ordinary informational purposes. Public viewing of marketing pages does **not** grant rights to use code, designs, or other proprietary Materials.

